{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Суукка тоңбос жабуусун,", "text": "Суукка тоңбос жабуусун,", "en": "His covering that would not freeze in the cold,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word is provisionally жабуусун; the compressed middle strokes could conceal a different possessive ending. The object continues the preceding page.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Паана кылган бараның,", "text": "Паана кылган бараның,", "en": "Your mighty protector in whom you took refuge,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The initial consonant of Паана and the final ң of бараның are not fully distinct; retain this reading rather than regularizing to баана.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Баатыр көк жал эр Кенен,", "text": "Баатыр көк жал эр Кенен,", "en": "The warrior, gray-maned hero Kenen,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Алда таала кудайдан,", "text": "Алда таала кудайдан,", "en": "From God the Almighty,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Алда is the apparent written form of the divine name; not silently expanded to Алла. The connected лд strokes remain uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Сурап алган карааның,", "text": "Сурап алган карааның,", "en": "The protector you obtained through prayer,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The ending of карааның may instead be караанын; the second-person possessive and hence the English pronoun are provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Эки арстан кырааның,", "text": "Эки арстан кырааның,", "en": "Your two lion-like champions,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The last word is difficult: provisionally кырааның, an epithet for champions; кыраалын is another possible letter sequence. The English renders the provisional epithet.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Эбегей, Көгөй эки дөө,", "text": "Эбегей, Көгөй эки дөө,", "en": "Ebegey and Kogoy, the two giants,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Эсинен кетип бул экөө,", "text": "Эсинен кетип бул экөө,", "en": "These two were beside themselves,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Башта күнү түш көргөн,", "text": "Башта күнү түш көргөн,", "en": "They had dreamed on an earlier day,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Башынан мүшкүл иш көргөн.", "text": "Башынан мүшкүл иш көргөн.", "en": "They had lived through grievous trouble.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Чымындай жанга күч көргөн,", "text": "Чымындай жанга күч көргөн,", "en": "Their fragile lives had felt great strain,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Чын кыргыз үчүн түш көргөн,", "text": "Чын кыргыз үчүн түш көргөн,", "en": "They had dreamed for the true Kyrgyz people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Уялаш жолборс эгизди,", "text": "Уялаш жолборс эгизди,", "en": "The twin tigers of one litter,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Эбегей, Көгөй чакырды,", "text": "Эбегей, Көгөй чакырды,", "en": "Ebegey and Kogoy summoned them,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Эки арстан теңизди.", "text": "Эки арстан теңизди.", "en": "The two lions, vast as the sea.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "теңизди is legible and verified in print, but its epithetic sense here is uncertain; the English retains the sea image rather than replacing it with an unrelated epithet.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Экөө жетип келди эле,", "text": "Экөө жетип келди эле,", "en": "The two had arrived,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Эбегей, Көгөй эки авам,", "text": "Эбегей, Көгөй эки авам,", "en": "Ebegey and Kogoy, my two elders,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word appears авам, including manuscript в; авасы is possible from the ending. The first-person shift is retained provisionally. A pencil underline and small cross do not erase the verse.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Эки аванын алдына,", "text": "Эки аванын алдына,", "en": "Before the two elders,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Кыяндуу кылыч байланып,", "text": "Кыяндуу кылыч байланып,", "en": "With formidable swords strapped on,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The adjective before кылыч is provisionally Кыяндуу; its joined middle letters are difficult, possibly Кыяптуу. Formidable is a tentative contextual rendering.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Бурчак болчу булуттай,", "text": "Бурчак болчу булуттай,", "en": "Like clouds about to bring hail,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Заар жүзүнө айланып,", "text": "Заар жүзүнө айланып,", "en": "Their faces turned fierce,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word looks Заар; каар would be idiomatic but is not substituted for the visible initial. The English takes заар as fierceness or venom.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Экөө жетип келгенде,", "text": "Экөө жетип келгенде,", "en": "When the two arrived,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Акырын айтып кеп баштап,", "text": "Акырын айтып кеп баштап,", "en": "Speaking softly, he began his account,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Аяк жагын бек таштап,", "text": "Аяк жагын бек таштап,", "en": "Firmly leaving its ending aside,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final verb appears таштап and agrees with print, but the idiom аяк жагын бек таштап is unclear. The English gives a provisional literal sense, without inventing a narrative action.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Күнгө келди Эбегей,", "text": "Күнгө келди Эбегей,", "en": "Ebegey came into the sunlight,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Күнгө is supported by the printed witness, but the nasal letter resembles ң in the manuscript. The unusual phrase is translated literally rather than emended to a speech formula.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Түш көрдүм балам жору деп,", "text": "Түш көрдүм балам жору деп,", "en": "Saying, “I had a dream, my son; interpret it,”", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Тилге келди эр Көгөй,", "text": "Тилге келди эр Көгөй,", "en": "Hero Kogoy began to speak,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Эки уялаш жолборсум,", "text": "Эки уялаш жолборсум,", "en": "“My two tigers of one litter,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Уйкуда мүшкүл түш көрдүм,", "text": "Уйкуда мүшкүл түш көрдүм,", "en": "In sleep I had a troubling dream,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Балаасы кабат иш көрдүм,", "text": "Балаасы кабат иш көрдүм,", "en": "I saw troubles piled one upon another,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Көргөн түшүм оңкон түш,", "text": "Көргөн түшүм оңкон түш,", "en": "The dream I saw was a fortunate dream,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The adjective looks оңкон, but that positive meaning conflicts with the following ominous lines. A negative form may have been intended; no invisible negative syllable is supplied. English follows the provisional visible reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Жүрөктү азап чалган түш,", "text": "Жүрөктү азап чалган түш,", "en": "A dream in which anguish struck the heart,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Калк мүшкүлгө калган түш,", "text": "Калк мүшкүлгө калган түш,", "en": "A dream in which the people fell into distress,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l034", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 34, "raw": "Эбегей, Көгөй эки авам,", "text": "Эбегей, Көгөй эки авам,", "en": "Ebegey and Kogoy, my two elders,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word appears авам, matching l017, but the possessive ending and the resulting change of voice are uncertain. Manuscript в is retained rather than modernized to б.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l035", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 35, "raw": "Чын дүйнөгө барган түш,", "text": "Чын дүйнөгө барган түш,", "en": "A dream of going to the true world beyond,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The word дүйнөгө has compressed medial strokes; the reading and its interpretation as the afterlife are provisional. The subject is left implicit as in the manuscript.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l036", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 36, "raw": "Ак калпак кыргыз кайран эл,", "text": "Ак калпак кыргыз кайран эл,", "en": "The dear Kyrgyz people in their white kalpaks,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf107:l037", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 107, "folio": 490, "line_in_page": 37, "raw": "Бир мүшкүлгө калган түш.", "text": "Бир мүшкүлгө калган түш.", "en": "A dream in which they fell into calamity.”", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
